---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import clientPhoto from '../assets/ClientMingAi.jpeg';
---

<section class="section" id="testimonials">
  <h2>What clients say</h2>
  <p class="lead">Feedback from people who train with Reno.</p>
  {/* One client's review: the original Chinese, with an English translation below it. */}
  <div class="testimonial-grid single">
    <blockquote class="quote">
      <p lang="zh-Hans">我非常喜欢Reno的私教服务：他非常专业。对任何训练动作的要求很高，每次的训练可以达到最好的训练效果，并且安全。他是我目前最关心学员的私教老师。</p>
      <p class="quote-translation">
        “I really enjoy training with Reno. He is very professional and holds every movement to a
        high standard, so each session is as effective as it can be, and always safe. Of all the
        trainers I have worked with, he cares the most about his clients.”
        <span class="quote-note">Translated from Chinese</span>
      </p>
      <footer>
        <Image src={clientPhoto} width={96} height={96} fit="cover" alt="" loading="lazy" />
        <cite>Ming A., Calgary</cite>
      </footer>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>
